# pii-guard denylist — SAMPLE / FORMAT REFERENCE ONLY.
#
# ⚠ DO NOT put real names here and DO NOT commit a real denylist. The real list
# is a PII index — it belongs OUTSIDE the repo. Copy this format to:
#     ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-~/.config}/pii-guard/denylist      (shared, all repos)
#   or  ./.pii-denylist                                      (gitignored, this repo)
#   or point $PII_GUARD_DENYLIST at a file.
#
# One extended-regex (ERE) pattern per line, matched case-insensitively.
# '#' comments and blank lines are ignored. Patterns can be literal names or
# regexes. Anchor with \b to avoid substring noise (UTIL → "utility").
#
# --- People (you, family, coworkers, your boss) ---
# Firstname
# Lastname
# \bNickname\b
#
# --- Employer / orgs ---
# Some Company Inc
# \bACME\b
#
# --- Internal hostnames / domains / IPs ---
# yourdomain\.example
# \b(HOSTA|HOSTB)\b
# 10\.0\.0\.
# 192\.168\.
#
# --- Predecessor / sibling project codenames an outsider shouldn't see ---
# OldProjectName
